  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.45 Ledge Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat on Ledge Pond in the town of Madison.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5540, eff 12-24-92, EXPIRED: 12-24-98; ss by #7798, eff 12-3-02; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.33); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.41) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
